@CourseManagement_HostAddress = http://localhost:5023

### Test Error 400 (Bad Request)
GET {{CourseManagement_HostAddress}}/api/errors/bad-request
Accept: application/json

###

### Test Error 404 (Not Found)
GET {{CourseManagement_HostAddress}}/api/errors/not-found
Accept: application/json

###

### Test Error 401 (Unauthorized)
GET {{CourseManagement_HostAddress}}/api/errors/unauthorized
Accept: application/json

###

### Test Error 500 (Internal Server Error)
GET {{CourseManagement_HostAddress}}/api/errors/server
Accept: application/json

###

### Seed 100 Users
POST {{CourseManagement_HostAddress}}/api/users/seed?count=100
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Users Paged (Trang 1, 10 user)
GET {{CourseManagement_HostAddress}}/api/users?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Search Users (Tìm theo tên hoặc lọc theo Role)
GET {{CourseManagement_HostAddress}}/api/users?searchTerm=Nguyễn&role=Student&sortBy=CreatedAt&isDescending=true
Accept: application/json

###
